{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"easter_eggs/locales/kr/15010352/document_333.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/document_15010352_333","lang":"kr","texts":{"document:333":{"text":"부품 구성: 본체 몸통, 머리 부품, 팔 부품, 다리 부품, 가동 관절\n도면에 따라 차례대로 조립하면 된다.\n동력 방식: <style=\"highlight\">에너지원</style>을 가슴 부분에 넣는다.\n......\n최종 버전! 절대 수정 없음!!\n......","source_cn":"零件组成：主体躯干；头部组件；手臂组件；腿部组件；活动关节\n依照图纸依次组装即可\n供能方式：将<style=\"highlight\">能量源</style>置入胸膛部位\n……\n最后一版，绝对绝对不改了！！\n……","status":"matched","document_title":"목각인형 설계도","document_title_cn":"木偶设计稿","document_title_status":"matched"}},"speakers":{}},"easter_eggs/menus/15010352_1_1.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_15010352:1:1","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:10004140:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:十六":{"text":"16호","source":"十六","status":"exact_hash"}}},"easter_eggs/menus/15010352_1_8.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_15010352:1:8","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:10004140:2":{"text":"사람, 사람. 16호, 기뻐요.","source_cn":"人，是人。十六，开心。","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:十六":{"text":"16호","source":"十六","status":"exact_hash"}}},"easter_eggs/menus/15010352_1_8__post_15341050.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"easter_eggs/menu_15010352:1:8__post_15341050","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:10049340:1":{"text":"사람! 사람, 만나서. 기뻐요!","source_cn":"人，见到人，开心！","status":"matched_runtime_gender_keys_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:十六":{"text":"16호","source":"十六","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/kr/ep5/env_story/15341010.json":{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15341010","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15341010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1534101001:0":{"text":"광원을 꺼내자, 16호는 더 이상 움직일 수도, 말하지도 못하는 평범한 목각인형이 되어버리고 말았다.","source_cn":"光源被取出后，十六彻底变回了无法行动和言语的木偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0ED7B751C48C621B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_in